  "spell.hazennstuff.death_sentence": "Death Sentence",
  "spell.hazennstuff.death_sentence.guide": "A Honkai Star-Rail Reference \u0027\u0027That paradise may be unreachable for me... Savor it in my place\u0027\u0027",
